<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Siltek says in talks, issues a cautionary.</title>
<headline>Siltek says in talks, issues a cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Siltek Ltd said on Monday it was involved in negotiations which could have an effect on its share price and urged shareholders to exerise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
